Wired after a long scroll? Try this before you decide what to do next.

Two physiological sighs: in through the nose, a short top-up sip, then a long, slow exhale through the mouth. Then three breaths of 4-6: in for 4, out for 6.

That's under a minute. Slow breathing near 6 breaths a minute has the strongest research behind it. We put five patterns with exact counts in one place, and DeRot is built around this moment. {url}

